;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;&lt;strong style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;韩国与美国的联盟&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/Rdh9WXIwuOTFTzCZ38JwY0sZQ4IM8ebc7FB_HYJpHbRSAoyefIdfBJwW-s7wCM1BIkXdzG5NCFtcid-U4viv6K6xr2PouM0jdMYp6yubQW5ouZP9lgXoLKO-hJF4ehNQbdQXyJDw7tMnlLLxUH1hPWO96wxWTj4dCRKJk7zoGfeTGPvYGxCltCbxLKeyevz_DzI88wVjLH1EoLdheS5YGKZcxXq1GV9ToGOz3voJjNGYcdaTUdnVD6S2gt6dSjKKFRtqfMlllZkzvDnij8V-mSTGvMFCsxJrDhVqDFHgiEPkMkKnKJX0HGN_dyU3Y31sv71gsSlB9AhSna9YRogFWFKD9jzeWIs90z8LiZ0RVnt6jY2V4oeBG2FhU3aqeGDqANn2CG0agKWnHHNp-LOwspkg3EBprTAmXk0ChUuX9kMyiVZbERTttu6mwJpbbsBwR6oiOw2RTi58u4-pB7kYOkFPDBujjpF7GxTreK6Lraj4Mw_5icQVJ8XhJXehLYi1XMeLvxegAPuMy88Sn5QM1WQEJQFIrhcjHGsIf-neh8iWuA/Lgtjcc6u_Pav_B5l_Kx7VEkf3LYkx0Tv/25" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="美国与韩国关系因情报纠纷陷入低谷"&gt;正受到从投资交易到情报泄露等各种争端的考验&lt;/a&gt;，从而损害了应对朝鲜的能力。首尔驻美国最高特使罕见地承认华盛顿共享秘密数据存在“问题”。几个月来，两国关系一直不稳定，朝鲜加大导弹试验力度，特朗普提议重启与金正恩的会谈，安全伙伴关系中的摩擦不断蔓延。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;&lt;strong style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;欧盟正准备&lt;/strong&gt;建立新的贸易强国，完全&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/5t0xglzr41wyF9yt65Tp-K_mAJi9khkjgUqOy-1vxDt5htasBOoCcAy0BUifT06Ehc6SaFi8GzoHAeKfMSiST-zCmzAQPxGKQH0lCCq894bKbPwnlpGOYmI-HksK3L_M19Y80tuv6r1vnc-ecfyYU-HNPYmuCkkMj4--sP1_gvvbndN8BPhHkrmYvqjMs05rvXYovIGceKH_ypaP_es-XWCQOGu41kK3gcI9XkS0cxrI6xLN37pXq95I4sQJR14yejUU26TvVGzYypyl-wNyUNh76Eiy3nnPKHr90kS1jms57kRyikjpK4MzFIeaMb_KlkFR5jk6BNPjZKzpT8g06vq7RzLcbT6YnT7gJeShuTXPkILzGHfzf0XUBRS7gfSVRDrbyAitl-6HET_CTCEeWmYwhK_kBPhA5l01xNBJo0jPDB7YcNuegV4ofVJRE3fDSTBAzjeuHrbWh9Tnxj6toYj6S0hRPQ0yg2VQ9wdko7Rii2Kpn99HUHg54txLE-MuesvVApROxN8knC96WuVRdirqhrVxZS_lQx2KQ09hfUx_qlw/IEFweSBDLcjJBMG2kf6CfbD2JO-3TCq1/25" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="欧盟将在贸易战中加强阻止中国进口的权力"&gt;切断其单一市场的准入&lt;/a&gt;，作为削减对华贸易逆差的新举措的一部分。消息人士称，昨天在布鲁塞尔举行的领导人会议要求欧盟委员会在今年年底前制